{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06514","headline":"至嵩阳观观即天皇故宅 · 储光羲","name":"至嵩阳观观即天皇故宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真人上清室，乃在中峰前。\n花雾生玉井，霓裳画列仙。\n念兹宫故宇，多此地新泉。\n松柏有清阴，薜萝亦自妍。\n一闻步虚子，又话逍遥篇。\n忽若在云汉，风中意泠然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}